  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peacebuilding: Supporting Marginalised (ROMA) Communities in BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to: a) develop research on the sufferings of the Roma, b) provide a platform to hear the voice of Roma war-time victims and c) design and implement Roma specific commemoration activities.</narrative>
  </description>
